<ul>
  <li>The 6 R’s of cloud migration: rehost, replatform, repurchase, refactor, retire, retain</li>
  <li>How to assess and prioritize workloads for migration</li>
  <li>Migration planning and risk management</li>
  <li>Data migration strategies and challenges</li>
  <li>How to maintain business continuity during migration</li>
  <li>Post-migration optimization and operations</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="who-this-is-for">Who This Is For</h2>

<p>Technology leaders, architects, and engineers who are planning or executing a cloud migration and want a structured approach based on industry best practices.</p>
